\section{Conclusion}

In this paper, we present the first study on how generative pre-trained language models (GPT-3) can be deployed for the automatic detection of low quality scientific papers. Our experimental results show that the GPT-3 language models can accurately and efficiently detect a majority of the low quality papers, with a small number of parameters.

